ORBITAL DATA

Orbital elements (OMM) and the satellite catalogue (SATCAT) originate with U.S.
Space Command and are obtained via Space-Track.org and CelesTrak (celestrak.org).
U.S. Space Command has provided express blanket approval for the transfer and
redistribution of basic space situational awareness data — orbital elements,
the satellite catalogue, and decay data — conditioned on appropriate citation.
This project uses only that category of data, and cites it as:

    Orbital data: U.S. Space Command, via Space-Track.org; satellite catalogue
    via CelesTrak (celestrak.org).

The U.S. Government does not warrant the accuracy or completeness of this data.
Conjunction data messages, covariance and other advanced products are not used
and are not covered by that approval.

